Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:03.44,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,It's not like we've seen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:06.82,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,the end of the world with our own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:13.95,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,That's why we gotta cast off {\fscx250}-{\r} together, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:27.00,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Sailing from sea to sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.85,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,saying it's nothing but a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:38.78,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Truth is stranger than fiction, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.18,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:50.04,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Common sense is only what the majority says it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.99,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,It's not like we've seen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:57.41,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,the end of the world with our own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,So let's go, Captain I'll-Do-It-My-Way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.67,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Whaddya mean, "no can do"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:07.75,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We haven't even started yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:12.72,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,I wanna know it all!  Now, yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!  You can!  This moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We can!  I can!  With this feeling of freedom...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Now...  Now, oh yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
